# Okta demo-org seeding (seed/) — these hold real org identifiers and must not
# be committed: data/ is the exported group/rule/app CSVs, .state/ records the
# ids of users a run created. The script itself is safe to commit; it reads the
# org URL and API token from the environment only.
seed/data/
seed/.state/

